用药具体清单","GDMT维持与调整规则"],"target":"GDMT具体药物类别与维持要求"},{"action":"确认GDMT以外的合并用药是否允许使用、是否需研究者或医学监查员事先批准、是否需记录于特定CRF页面","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_661_02","missing_source_classes":["非GDMT合并用药审批规则"],"target":"非GDMT合并用药审批"}],"heading":"允许的合并用药/治疗","missing_source_classes":["允许合并用药具体清单","GDMT维持与调整规则","非GDMT合并用药审批规则"],"proposal_text":"本研究所有受试者在12周双盲治疗期内联合标准心衰药物治疗（GDMT）背景，该背景治疗在筛选前已维持稳定剂量至少4周。受试者入组时已稳定使用的GDMT方案在治疗期间原则上维持不变，若因临床需要调整GDMT种类或剂量，研究者应记录调整原因、调整日期及调整后方案。除GDMT背景治疗外，其他合并用药是否允许使用由研究者根据受试者临床需要判断，并在病例报告表中记录药物名称、剂量、起止日期及用药指征。","rationale":"项目来源确认研究设计为联合标准GDMT背景治疗，入选标准要求筛选前≥4周稳定剂量GDMT仍有心衰症状。GDMT具体药物类别范围、是否要求整个治疗期维持不变、新增或调整GDMT是否需研究者批准、GDMT以外的合并用药审批规则及记录方式，项目来源未逐一列明，需医学经理确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_f738c43b16eb_6585904be71784ee","section_number":"6.6.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:55b50e81c4f1fd5a7a98e901","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:r6:2324e1714eed68be"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"f9a827ee02675c381ba3be95fa0b7039a0966d11e72ee5bf95bac679848716c2","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_f738c43b16eb_cddf6069d94acdfa:full-draft:55b50e81c4f1fd5a7a98e901","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:55b50e81c4f1fd5a7a98e901","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:db9e2160842cb61e13e728128f749f9e5d2f83cc6d60fa35f8ce6f52a79c1352:55b50e81c4f1fd5a7a98e901","text_sha256":"f9a827ee02675c381ba3be95fa0b7039a0966d11e72ee5bf95bac679848716c2"},{"content_sha256":"9d5acf701fc24d461aa8f13015397fcaa97575cf704bd83033a411b2b260322a","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:revision:6","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:r6:2324e1714eed68be","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:r6:2324e